     9| * native binding, a circular dependency, a Supabase init throw), the error
    10| * boundary can never catch it because the module never finishes evaluating.
    11| * In a production APK this produces a permanent black screen with no error.
    12| *
    13| * By keeping _layout.tsx ultra-minimal, the first frame always paints a
    14| * visible loading screen. Then _providers.tsx is import()'d asynchronously.
    15| * If it throws or times out, we show the full error on screen.
